# Phase 6: Project Documentation

## Introduction
LegalEase is an AI-powered application that creates draft legal documents.

## Modules
1. User Interface Module
2. Input Collection Module
3. AI Integration Module
4. Document Generation Module
5. Download Module

## Testing
- Verify document type selection.
- Check required field validation.
- Test API error handling.
- Verify generated draft output.
- Test document download.

## Limitations
- AI output may contain errors.
- Generated drafts may not meet every legal requirement.
- Professional review is necessary.

## Future Enhancements
- PDF and DOCX downloads
- Tamil language support
- Secure document history
- More document templates
